  "abstract": "Second point in the Huber sweep on the simple Fourier LN ScalarRamp baseline: replace MAE with Huber(\u03b4=0.02), keep curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, drop=0.05, p=36, H=128, learn_gamma=False. Tests robustness to heavier tail smoothing without changing the backbone.",
